{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c741","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa23-c753-7e20-ba14-a3c953f652a1"},"sequence":507,"recorded_at":1780531400001009,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"60ee70b2-d33d-438c-9a26-1cd548916052","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"60ee70b2-d33d-438c-9a26-1cd548916052","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"60ee70b2-d33d-438c-9a26-1cd548916052"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa25-89d9-77e3-8d2b-b789d95cf317"},"task_id":"01a0aa25-89d9-77e3-8d2b-b789d95cf317","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa25-89d9-77e3-8d2b-b789d95cf317","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.task-board/.resources/BUG-260916-1rqn1c/BUG-260916-1rqn1c_toolchain-evidence.md`.\n1|# BUG-260916-1rqn1c toolchain evidence (official sources)\n2|\n3|Fetched 2026-09-16. All URLs are `actions/runner-images @ main` unless noted.\n4|\n5|## 1. Hosted failure (primary source)\n6|\n7|- PR: relux-works/relux-tunnel#6\n8|  (`delivery/STORY-260715-1y04r0-rev3`, head\n9|  `d45c85d67b78b6578b5cb0821bd2e78217124d30`, OPEN).\n10|- Run: 35091586150 (`gh run view 35091586150 --repo relux-works/relux-tunnel`).\n11|- Failed job: `generated project credential-free validation`\n12|  (ID 104778924295), step `Run the local credential-free gate`.\n13|- Observed stage order: relay-tool-bootstrap PASS, relay-packaging PASS,\n14|  validation-contract-tests PASS, deterministic-generation PASS,\n15|  macos-target-builds-and-contracts PASS, core-boundaries PASS,\n16|  swift-testing PASS, swift-release-build PASS, native-packaging FAIL\n17|  (exit 2).\n18|- Failing command and output (from `--log-failed`):\n19|  `make check-native-dependencies` ->\n20|  `python3 scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py verify` ->\n21|  `libssh2-fork-tool: Xcode build mismatch: expected Build version 17F42,\n22|  got Xcode 16.4 / Build version 16F6`.\n23|\n24|## 2. Runner label table (official, README.md)\n25|\n26|| Image | Arch | YAML labels |\n27|| macOS 26 | x64 | `macos-latest-large`, `macos-26-intel`, `macos-26-large` |\n28|| macOS 26 Arm64 | arm64 | `macos-latest`, `macos-26`, `macos-26-xlarge` |\n29|| macOS 15 | x64 | `macos-15-large`, `macos-15-intel` |\n30|| macOS 15 Arm64 | arm64 | `macos-15`, `macos-15-xlarge` |\n31|\n32|`macos-26` is the arm64 image: same architecture as `macos-15`, so the\n33|existing arm64 Mise checksum pairing in ci.yml is preserved. `macos-latest`\n34|already points at macOS 26 Arm64 (GA).\n35|\n36|## 3. Xcode inventory, macos-15-arm64 (cannot host the pin)\n37|\n38|Source: `images/macos/macos-15-arm64-Readme.md` (identical Xcode table in\n39|`macos-15-Readme.md`).\n40|\n41|| Version | Build | Path |\n42|| 26.3 | 17C529 | /Applications/Xcode_26.3.app |\n43|| 26.2 | 17C52 | /Applications/Xcode_26.2.app |\n44|| 26.1.1 | 17B100 | /Applications/Xcode_26.1.1.app |\n45|| 26.0.1 | 17A400 | /Applications/Xcode_26.0.1.app |\n46|| 16.4 (default) | 16F6 | /Applications/Xcode_16.4.app |\n47|| 16.3 | 16E140 | /Applications/Xcode_16.3.app |\n48|| 16.2 | 16C5032a | /Applications/Xcode_16.2.app |\n49|| 16.1 | 16B40 | /Applications/Xcode_16.1.app |\n50|| 16.0 | 16A242d | /Applications/Xcode_16.app |\n51|\n52|Newest available: 26.3 (17C529). Pinned 17F42 absent. Default 16F6 matches\n53|the hosted failure exactly.\n54|\n55|## 4. Xcode inventory, macos-26-arm64 (hosts the pin)\n56|\n57|Source: `images/macos/macos-26-arm64-Readme.md` (identical Xcode table in\n58|`macos-26-Readme.md`). Image Version: 20260907.0351.1, macOS 26.6.2.\n59|\n60|| Version | Build | Path |\n61|| 26.6 (default) | 17F113 | /Applications/Xcode_26.6.app |\n62|| 26.5 | 17F42 | /Applications/Xcode_26.5.app |\n63|| 26.4.1 | 17E202 | /Applications/Xcode_26.4.1.app |\n64|| 26.3 | 17C529 | /Applications/Xcode_26.3.app |\n65|| 26.2 | 17C52 | /Applications/Xcode_26.2.app |\n66|| 26.1.1 | 17B100 | /Applications/Xcode_26.1.1.app |\n67|| 26.0.1 | 17A400 | /Applications/Xcode_26.0.1.app |\n68|\n69|Pinned 17F42 present at `/Applications/Xcode_26.5.app`, but the image\n70|default is 26.6 (17F113): the workflow must select explicitly, not just\n71|move images. Installed SDKs include macOS/iOS/tvOS/watchOS 26.5 under\n72|Xcode 26.5/26.6; deployment minimums (macOS 15.0, iOS 18.0) are\n73|compiler-supported as proven by artifact provenance (built with 17F42).\n74|\n75|## 5. Repository pin sources (unchanged by this fix)\n76|\n77|- `NativeDependencies/manifest.json`:\n78|  `dependencies.libssh2-openssl.compiler.xcode_build = \"17F42\"`,\n79|  `dependencies.hev-lwip.rebuild.xcode_build = \"17F42\"`.\n80|- `Probes/macOSPacketTunnelProbe/README.md`: recorded baseline is\n81|  Xcode 26.5 (`17F42`).\n82|- Enforcement: `verify_xcode_build` in `scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py`\n83|  (runs `xcodebuild -version`, requires `Build version 17F42`).\n84|\n85|## 6. Local toolchain strings (validation context)\n86|\n87|- `xcodebuild -version`: Xcode 26.5, Build version 17F42 (selected).\n88|- `xcode-select -p`: `/Applications/Xcode_26_5.app/Contents/Developer`\n89|  (note underscores: local install naming differs from hosted runners).\n90|- Also installed: `Xcode_26_6.app` (Xcode 26.6, build 17F113 — same\n91|  build as the macos-26 hosted default; used for the negative proof via\n92|  `DEVELOPER_DIR` override, exit 1, no system mutation).\n93|- `swift --version`: Apple Swift 6.3.2, target arm64-apple-macosx28.0.\n94|- Host: macOS 27.0 (26A428).","final_result":true}}}
