{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c745","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa23-c753-7e20-ba14-a3c953f652a1"},"sequence":509,"recorded_at":1780531400001013,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"60ee70b2-d33d-438c-9a26-1cd548916052","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"60ee70b2-d33d-438c-9a26-1cd548916052","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"60ee70b2-d33d-438c-9a26-1cd548916052"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa25-89b8-76b3-b50f-1ac938a1caff"},"task_id":"01a0aa25-89b8-76b3-b50f-1ac938a1caff","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa25-89b8-76b3-b50f-1ac938a1caff","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.task-board/.resources/BUG-260916-1rqn1c/BUG-260916-1rqn1c_results.md`.\n1|# BUG-260916-1rqn1c results: hosted native Xcode toolchain alignment\n2|\n3|## Diagnosis (hosted evidence)\n4|\n5|PR6 `d45c85d67b78b6578b5cb0821bd2e78217124d30`, hosted run 35091586150,\n6|job `generated project credential-free validation` (ID 104778924295):\n7|all gate stages PASS through `swift-release-build`, then `native-packaging`\n8|(`make check-native-dependencies`) FAILS with exit 2:\n9|\n10|```\n11|python3 scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py verify\n12|+ xcodebuild -version\n13|libssh2-fork-tool: Xcode build mismatch: expected Build version 17F42, got Xcode 16.4\n14|Build version 16F6\n15|```\n16|\n17|Root cause: the job runs on `macos-15`, whose default AND selectable Xcodes\n18|cannot satisfy the manifest pin. Official inventory\n19|(actions/runner-images, image 20260907.0351.1) shows macos-15[-arm64] ships\n20|at most Xcode 26.3 (17C529) with default Xcode 16.4 (16F6), while the pinned\n21|Xcode 26.5 (17F42) at `/Applications/Xcode_26.5.app` exists only on the\n22|GA `macos-26`/`macos-26-arm64` images — whose default is Xcode 26.6\n23|(17F113), so an explicit selection is required on top of the image move.\n24|Full tables: `BUG-260916-1rqn1c_toolchain-evidence.md`.\n25|\n26|Both manifest pins agree on the single toolchain (`libssh2-openssl`\n27|`compiler.xcode_build` == `hev-lwip` `rebuild.xcode_build` == `17F42`);\n28|the libssh2 pin is enforced at verify time by\n29|`verify_xcode_build` in `scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py`, the hev pin governs\n30|rebuild provenance. No pin, artifact, or product byte changes.\n31|\n32|## Fix (narrow compatibility delta)\n33|\n34|1. `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, job `generated-project-credential-free`:\n35|   `runs-on: macos-15` -> `macos-26` (arm64 label, so the arm64 Mise\n36|   checksum pairing is unchanged), plus a step running\n37|   `sh ./scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` before the credential-free gate.\n38|2. `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` (new): reads both manifest pins, refuses\n39|   on missing/disagreeing pins (exit 2) and on builds with no supported\n40|   hosted Xcode (exit 2, fail closed), selects the mapped Xcode via\n41|   `xcode-select -s` (skipped when already selected), then verifies\n42|   `xcodebuild -version` contains `Build version <pin>` (exit 1 on\n43|   mismatch, same wording as the downstream gate).\n44|3. `scripts/tests/test_native_toolchain_alignment.py` (new, 12 tests) and\n45|   `scripts/tests/test_native_toolchain_mutants.py` (new harness).\n46|\n47|Not changed: manifest pins, native artifacts, strict version checks,\n48|`verify_xcode_build`, product sources, other CI jobs (relay jobs never run\n49|native packaging). No VPN, no weakened checks.\n50|\n51|## Prerequisite stack identity (reused bytes, NOT new scope)\n52|\n53|- PR6 head: `d45c85d67b78b6578b5cb0821bd2e78217124d30` (verified via\n54|  rev-parse; also origin PR #6 head `delivery/STORY-260715-1y04r0-rev3`).\n55|- Worktree HEAD (unmoved, nothing committed):\n56|  `b3422b05226253a17676b9b84c764071fe3dbe74` on\n57|  `task-board/story/STORY-260916-19w99a`.\n58|- Overlay: all 59 tracked non-board paths checked out from PR6 head;\n59|  every staged blob byte-equal to PR6 head; staged stat 59 files,\n60|  8970 insertions, 65 deletions (same set as BUG-260916-2764p8).\n61|- Candidate layout: staged = prerequisite overlay; unstaged = ci.yml\n62|  delta; untracked = 3 new files (snapshot-captured); `.task-board`\n63|  artifact untouched.\n64|\n65|## New delta identity (vs PR6 head, non-board)\n66|\n67|- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: 10 insertions, 2 deletions;\n68|  blob `740e64f93cc34a3e55e5141502fe58012f0973a2` ->\n69|  `205b10013422af7e43ead2a0fcd1b20ac627a4eb`.\n70|- `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh` (new, +x): blob\n71|  `2489aa2dc776d5266ea68f45282b4493c356e2d6`.\n72|- `scripts/tests/test_native_toolchain_alignment.py` (new): blob\n73|  `d53f9a42bc9eb2a49d039ff53dae429a997b1188`.\n74|- `scripts/tests/test_native_toolchain_mutants.py` (new): blob\n75|  `75dc0d05a6e6dea6c3864c5c4b778919d0a4e19a`.\n76|- Prospective PR composition: PR6 head `d45c85d` + the 4 paths above.\n77|  The handoff publishes the exact candidate CR (tree OIDs + patch).\n78|\n79|## Validation (exit codes observed on the composed candidate)\n80|\n81|- New suite `test_native_toolchain_alignment.py`: 12/12 pass, exit 0.\n82|  Pre-fix it failed on the overlay tree (`runs-on: macos-26` not found,\n83|  no selection step) — authentic defect reproduced before the change.\n84|- Mutant harness `test_native_toolchain_mutants.py`: baseline 12/12\n85|  green, both mutants killed, exit 0 (see below).\n86|- `make check-native-dependencies` (exact hosted failing command):\n87|  exit 0 — strict gate passes where the toolchain matches (local\n88|  Xcode 26.5, build 17F42).\n89|- Downstream strictness preserved: `DEVELOPER_DIR=<Xcode 26.6>`\n90|  `libssh2-fork-tool.py verify` fails exit 1 with\n91|  `expected Build version 17F42, got Xcode 26.6 / Build version 17F113`\n92|  (no system state mutated; override only). The macos-26 default is\n93|  rejected, proving explicit selection is necessary, not just the move.\n94|- Real `sh scripts/select-native-xcode.sh`: exit 2 fail-closed\n95|  (`/Applications/Xcode_26.5.app is not installed`) — this dev machine\n96|  names its install `Xcode_26_5.app`; hosted runners use the documented\n97|  dotted name. Refusal precedes any system change. See bounds.\n98|- Workflow YAML parses (`yaml.safe_load`, same check CI runs).\n99|- `swift build`: exit 0 on the composed candidate.\n100|- Neighbor `test_macos_build_diagnostics.py`: 3/3 pass, exit 0.\n101|- `git diff --check`: clean. No linter configured in repo (no Makefile\n102|  lint target, no hidden linter configs) — nothing to run.\n103|\n104|## AC coverage: 4 of 6 rows driven through production entry\n105|\n106|Production call sites: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n107|(`generated-project-credential-free` job) -> `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh`\n108|-> downstream `scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py verify` (`verify_xcode_build`).\n109|\n110|1. Narrow reproducible fix — DRIVEN: ci.yml runs-on + selection step;\n111|   covered by `test_workflow_runs_credential_free_job_on_macos26`,\n112|   `test_workflow_selects_pinned_xcode_before_gate`, and 7 behavioral\n113|   selection tests through the production script.\n114|2. Independent review — STATED BOUND: reviewer stage, not producer-driven.\n115|3. Exact prospective PR composition identity — DRIVEN: identities above;\n116|   reviewer verifies staged tree == PR6 head minus board, then 4-path delta.\n117|4. Targeted validation — DRIVEN: 12-test suite + mutant harness + gates\n118|   above, all with observed exit codes.\n119|5. Honest hosted validation requirements handed to parent — DRIVEN: this\n120|   outcome + toolchain-evidence resource + bounds below.\n121|6. Real hosted publication/landing — STATED BOUND: parent delivery\n122|   obligation, explicitly out of producer scope.\n123|\n124|## Negative tests and narrowing mutants\n125|\n126|Production call site for all: `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh`\n127|(invoked as `sh <script>` with `RELUX_NATIVE_MANIFEST` /\n128|`RELUX_XCODE_ROOT` fixtures and PATH shims for `xcode-select`,\n129|`xcodebuild`, `sudo`).\n130|\n131|- `test_selection_rejects_xcode16_default`: 16F6 output -> nonzero exit +\n132|  `mismatch` (mirrors run35091586150).\n133|- `test_selection_rejects_macos26_default_build`: 17F113 (macos-26\n134|  default) -> nonzero exit + `mismatch`.\n135|- `test_selection_refuses_disagreeing_manifest_pins`,\n136|  `test_selection_refuses_unmapped_build`,\n137|  `test_selection_refuses_missing_pin`,\n138|  `test_selection_refuses_missing_install`: exit 2 refusals.\n139|- Mutant `admit-macos26-default-only` (gate stays present, additionally\n140|  admits 17F113): killed by `test_selection_rejects_macos26_default_build`\n141|  (exit 1, AssertionError).\n142|- Mutant `select-wrong-app-preserves-token` (every `17F42` literal kept,\n143|  mapped app changed to Xcode_26.6.app): full 12-test behavioral suite\n144|  run, killed by `test_selection_maps_manifest_pin_to_documented_app`\n145|  and `test_selection_is_idempotent_when_already_selected` on the\n146|  recorded selection path (exit 1).\n147|\n148|## Toolchain / proof bounds (honest)\n149|\n150|- Hosted proof (macos-26 + selection => native-packaging green) requires\n151|  publishing the prospective PR and observing run35091586150's successor;\n152|  that is a parent delivery gate, not claimed here.\n153|- The image move upgrades the whole credential-free job from Xcode 16.4\n154|  (Swift 6.1) to Xcode 26.5 (Swift 6.3.2-class). Currently-passing\n155|  stages (macos targets, swift tests) are expected to pass — local\n156|  Swift 6.3.2 + Xcode 26.5 builds and tests green — but hosted\n157|  confirmation is pending by construction.\n158|- Local real-run of the selection script cannot go green: this machine\n159|  installs the pinned toolchain as `/Applications/Xcode_26_5.app`\n160|  (underscores) while hosted runners use `/Applications/Xcode_26.5.app`\n161|  (documented). Hermetic behavioral tests stage the documented layout.\n162|- Full `credential-free-validate` not run locally (needs the legacy\n163|  