explicitly, not just\n71|move images. Installed SDKs include macOS/iOS/tvOS/watchOS 26.5 under\n72|Xcode 26.5/26.6; deployment minimums (macOS 15.0, iOS 18.0) are\n73|compiler-supported as proven by artifact provenance (built with 17F42).\n74|\n75|## 5. Repository pin sources (unchanged by this fix)\n76|\n77|- `NativeDependencies/manifest.json`:\n78|  `dependencies.libssh2-openssl.compiler.xcode_build = \"17F42\"`,\n79|  `dependencies.hev-lwip.rebuild.xcode_build = \"17F42\"`.\n80|- `Probes/macOSPacketTunnelProbe/README.md`: recorded baseline is\n81|  Xcode 26.5 (`17F42`).\n82|- Enforcement: `verify_xcode_build` in `scripts/libssh2-fork-tool.py`\n83|  (runs `xcodebuild -version`, requires `Build version 17F42`).\n84|\n85|## 6. Local toolchain strings (validation context)\n86|\n87|- `xcodebuild -version`: Xcode 26.5, Build version 17F42 (selected).\n88|- `xcode-select -p`: `/Applications/Xcode_26_5.app/Contents/Developer`\n89|  (note underscores: local install naming differs from hosted runners).\n90|- Also installed: `Xcode_26_6.app` (Xcode 26.6, build 17F113 — same\n91|  build as the macos-26 hosted default; used for the negative proof via\n92|  `DEVELOPER_DIR` override, exit 1, no system mutation).\n93|- `swift --version`: Apple Swift 6.3.2, target arm64-apple-macosx28.0.\n94|- Host: macOS 27.0 (26A428).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
