oducer initially piped commands to tail and was asked to preserve actual statuses. Reuse completed exact candidate full CR gate if valid, avoid redundant exhaustive suites.\n6|\n7|Independently run meaningful focused tests and required review gates, check negative/mutant evidence and report coverage honestly (manual process identity evidence is not an executable test). Verify no manifest/artifact/product/deployment-target changes. If defects exist, request changes with concrete minimal fixes; do not implement. If accepted use actual accept_cr and attach task-scoped verdict, candidate identity, prospective composition tree and bounds. No commits, publication, rootLOGBOOK writes, tooling changes, nested workers, VPN or route mutation. Parent owns exact signed-head GitHub review and landing after hosted checks.","final_result":true}}}
